I+\Delta

then:

\xrightarrow{\text{Microscope}}
\text{mechanism}

then:

\xrightarrow{\text{Causal Loom}}
\text{test}

then:

\xrightarrow{\text{Capability Port}}
\text{execution}

then:

\xrightarrow{\text{Time Scrubber}}
